			"text":"New Gate",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":270,
			"y":-1600,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"38eb02b7a69062bc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Tree Old Not Me\n\nC - I can not see the tree trunk.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":250,
			"y":-1380,
			"width":260,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"138c2c0a53fa555c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Dauvenja - End of Yesterday / Last Day?\n\n**Ulraajoram - Your first name large**\n\nNai Dau = Night Day ( Eclipse? )\n\nLorlu Raadau - You are not word night",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":250,
			"y":-1100,
			"width":300,
			"height":280
		},
		{
			"id":"e9d2292d190a3ea1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Eraja Nai - Eraja Night\n\n**Elcountvo - Me Count Away**\n\nLeavelu - Leave you not\n\nLe - I am not\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":250,
			"y":-760,
			"width":300,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"533c53d70bf28f2b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Inn Ett Iss - North East South\n\nEtt Trei - East Tree\n\n**Ajinn Ett Ovtrei Issja Treivo -** \n**First East Toward Tree, South Last Away From Tree**\n\nMainn Ettam Matrei Ettiss Maorr - \nSmall North, Long East, Small Tree, South East, Small West",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":190,
			"y":-500,
			"width":380,
			"height":300
		},
		{
			"id":"582505e23046e8d4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Oveldajiris\nToward my first (iris/hometown)\n\nUlelddau, Uleldnai, Ueldmova\nWe day, We night, We move(?)\nWe move through day and night (?)\n\nOvulelgift Eldhew Oviss\nToward our (gift/birthplace), my home is towards south.\n\nNevdau uldareile\nA new day, your future without me\n\nNevdau eldareilu.\nA new day, my future without you.\n\nAjelbid ulheed eldlor - Ulloddiris\nFirst me (bid) you (heed) my word - You (loddiris/lord)\n\nHewsinclairlu Hewepsenlu.. Forget uldein inn.\nThose who are not House Sinclair, Those who are not House Epsen.. Forget you (ein) north?\n\nUldjorjeari.. Uldareiovinnfennvo\nYour name (jeari/journey).. Your future is toward south (fennvo)\n\nUldeinjovovo Overaja\nYour (einj) toward toward toward Eraja.\n\nOviss Nevarei\nTowards south a new future.\n\nLorja Eldiris\nLast word, I (diris)\n\nUldjora\nYour name\n\n\nOvinn Nevarei = Towards the north is future\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-480,
			"y":-1220,
			"width":540,
			"height":1080
		},
